profile:
Russian Metal act presents heavy metal guitar riffs with evolving melodies and female vocals.

The band includes:
• Anton Mityugin - composer, bass guitarist;
• Aleksandr Sidelin - the author of music and lyrics, guitars;
• Miroslava Mirova-keyboards;
• Anton Zaitsev - drums;
• And Maya Gitsina, whose sensual vocals permeate all the compositions of the band

Thrash metal band from Kaunas, Lithuania. "Tručas" (slang word being used in some parts of Lithuania meaning poison) is a 90s kids thrash band. The band started in 2011. From the beginning the guys wanted to play something orientated to thrash metal.

Members:
Matas - Bass/Vocals;
Minvydas - Guitar;
Tautvydas - Guitar;
Paulius - Drums.
